is genuinely structured data (stats with numbers, feature comparison boxes).
Prefer prose in columns over smart-layout widgets in columns.`,
  },

  display: {
    allowed: false,
    guidance: `Never. Swiss emphasis comes from position and the grid, not type scale. Max heading: H1.
Breather cards use H1 with deliberate alignment (bottom-right, bottom-left, flush-left).
The grid, whitespace, and positioning create drama — not oversized type.`,
